  "body": "One of the best-value properties on the Hibiscus Coast, this is your chance to get your foot on the property ladder and own your own home before the holidays!\r\n\r\nPositioned as a prime, elevated and sunny end unit, this home has been recently renovated with modern upgrades, including brand-new paint and carpet throughout. Showing in immaculate, move-in-ready condition, it offers everything you could want in an affordable, well-thought-out three-bedroom package.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features the master bedroom with its own ensuite, alongside a spacious open-plan kitchen and living area flowing out to a private deck and facing north to capture all-day sun. Downstairs, you'll find two additional bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a patio opening out to your very own private garden - ideal for keen gardeners or planting your own fruit and vegies. Adding immense value and practicality is a two-car garage with internal access, supplemented by extra parking directly in front of the home plus a residents' and guests' carpark in the cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful spot at the end of the Palmgreen cul-de-sac, you'll enjoy being just minutes from Whangaparaoa shops, local schools, and Stanmore Bay Beach.\r\n\r\nTo give you complete peace of mind, a clean builder’s report is available upon request. Offered to the market for the very first time since the property was brand new, and with immediate possession available, you can unpack and be settled in before Christmas.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing!",
